  "body": "Bumps [docs-resources](https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources) from `14a3283` to `40844de`.\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/40844defba0d1bcad46ce690ebca51912fbb3f67\"><code>40844de</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/riscv/docs-resources/issues/119\">#119</a> from riscv/118-display-kind-and-instances</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/aa8e26f1852023d2dbcb61a31713b2ef654067f9\"><code>aa8e26f</code></a> Display kind and instances and rename ADOC/HTML columns to better match varie...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/44ca55ac346ce098996fe39a3a5a62a9f3bbbe37\"><code>44ca55a</code></a> Allow instance and tag (not always requiring instances and tags). Cleanup JSO...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/7f7f63ad85e2a34d339d4c2b714f7bcde08f6f05\"><code>7f7f63a</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/riscv/docs-resources/issues/117\">#117</a> from riscv/116-improve-display-of-norm-rules-sidebar-...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/7c7e45e5ab9b1f936982b721bfc7edf31527d8fd\"><code>7c7e45e</code></a> Made norm rule HTML sidebar more compact and display truncated tables</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/3e016746eb6721b3737043036b10b5d3f3809f2b\"><code>3e01674</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/riscv/docs-resources/issues/115\">#115</a> from riscv/114-improve-adoc-format-of-norm-rules</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/d099e94d702e631c27486816fd5bce1d95ed3863\"><code>d099e94</code></a> Added empty line</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/8207b366616733ee23e22ef2dfb539e1eade60f1\"><code>8207b36</code></a> Actually just decided it was easier to output native HTML instead of adoc to ...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/93422ee3983b1512e8a88d403101d54356c81455\"><code>93422ee</code></a> Merge pull request <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/riscv/docs-resources/issues/113\">#113</a> from riscv/111-create-asciidoc-with-tables-of-norm-rules</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/commit/95079dea5e900d396606646e37421d82fee716d2\"><code>95079de</code></a> Added adoc output format for norm rules</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/riscv/docs-resources/compare/14a3283ac4f78ce72938b1323423bfab08ece0b6...40844defba0d1bcad46ce690ebca51912fbb3f67\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't alter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting `@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits that have been made to it\n- `@dependabot merge` will merge this PR after your CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot squash and merge` will squash and merge this PR after your CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot cancel merge` will cancel a previously requested merge and block automerging\n- `@dependabot reopen` will reopen this PR if it is closed\n- `@dependabot close` will close this PR and stop Dependabot recreating it. You can achieve the same result by closing it manually\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all of the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n\n\n</details>",
